// Original path: library/coretests/tests/iter/adapters/map.rs
//   (test_double_ended_map subset — front-only)
//
// Modifications:
// - `xs.iter().map(|&x| x * -1)` → `iter_map::<…>(iter_copied::<SliceIter<i32>, i32>(iter_over_slice(&xs)),
//   fn_ptr)`. Closures aren't yet fn-ptrs at the trait-default-method
//   site without explicit fn-ptr signatures; using the free fn is the
//   canonical entry.
// - DEI half (`next_back`) deferred — MapIter doesn't yet impl
//   DoubleEndedIterator (separate SL-sl gap).
